	(text_box "Notes\n---\n\n- if U_{Bat} dips below 4V, P-MOSFET turns on --> schottky diode blocks reversed current flow\n- U_{Bat1}, U_{Bat2} needed by battery charger\n! current issue: Jetson Orin NX accepts 5VDC-20VDC through barrel plug\n	--> DC/DC buck converter could smooth voltage ripple caused by ESC but requires higher battery voltage (currently at 7.2V)\n= either increase battery voltage for buck converter or add capacitors for voltage ripple\n= gamble for now and use P-Mosfet supply with 1uF cap, MBR745 with U_{Forward-Max}=0.75V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
